{"id":"a5e10857074b912e","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","title":"Boolean Algebra","display":"df-boolean-algebra — Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-boolean-algebra","aliases":["58-df-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-boolean-algebra — Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-algebra — Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(B\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> (nonempty carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee\\in B^{B\\times B}\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee\\in B^{B\\times B}\\)</span> (binary operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\in B^B\">\\(\\neg\\in B^B\\)</span> (unary complement operation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in B\">\\(0,1\\in B\\)</span> (distinguished constants)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> (布尔代数谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1) \\leftrightarrow B\\neq\\emptyset \\land \\wedge\\in B^{B\\times B}\\land\\vee\\in B^{B\\times B} \\land \\neg\\in B^B \\land 0\\in B\\land1\\in B \\land \\forall a,b,c\\in B\\;\\bigl((a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c) \\land (a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c) \\land a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a \\land a\\vee b=b\\vee a \\land a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c) \\land a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c) \\land a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a \\land a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a \\land a\\wedge1=a \\land a\\vee0=a \\land a\\wedge\\neg a=0 \\land a\\vee\\neg a=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1) \\leftrightarrow B\\neq\\emptyset \\land \\wedge\\in B^{B\\times B}\\land\\vee\\in B^{B\\times B} \\land \\neg\\in B^B \\land 0\\in B\\land1\\in B \\land \\forall a,b,c\\in B\\;\\bigl((a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c) \\land (a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c) \\land a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a \\land a\\vee b=b\\vee a \\land a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c) \\land a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c) \\land a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a \\land a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a \\land a\\wedge1=a \\land a\\vee0=a \\land a\\wedge\\neg a=0 \\land a\\vee\\neg a=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the algebraic presentation of a complemented distributive lattice; the order is recoverable by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\">\\(a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(X)\\)</span> (power set), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0, 1\\}^n\">\\(\\{0, 1\\}^n\\)</span>, Lindenbaum-Tarski algebra.</li>\n<li>Stone representation theorem: every Boolean algebra is isomorphic to a field of sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\neq\\emptyset$ (nonempty carrier, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee\\in B^{B\\times B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\in B^B","display":false},{"tex":"0,1\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1) \\leftrightarrow B\\neq\\emptyset \\land \\wedge\\in B^{B\\times B}\\land\\vee\\in B^{B\\times B} \\land \\neg\\in B^B \\land 0\\in B\\land1\\in B \\land \\forall a,b,c\\in B\\;\\bigl((a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c) \\land (a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c) \\land a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a \\land a\\vee b=b\\vee a \\land a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c) \\land a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c) \\land a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a \\land a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a \\land a\\wedge1=a \\land a\\vee0=a \\land a\\wedge\\neg a=0 \\land a\\vee\\neg a=1\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0, 1\\}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"002f4c0140c1d3c2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"64a383191f67c404","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6$ (see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]])"},{"id":"0ad2193926edf61c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9366219236941f95","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"ae3d646bcf00672a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]])"},{"id":"91b9c548b9e50592","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"258c3795028ee0ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"87811b9038822859","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb0607459077d92c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"6a5374048e3f33d2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ is the Boolean-algebra predicate (see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"9535688e55559250","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b4442b7440f4f5a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2adc90a7b77db618","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"942c41e472f56c72","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6$（see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]）"},{"id":"5457c0fe86b8ee21","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B$ (Boolean-algebra carrier, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]])"},{"id":"216dbd76b0f27a99","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}$ (see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]]); write $a\\Rightarrow_B b$ for $\\neg_Ba\\vee_Bb$"},{"id":"c0536b9a92872a31","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)$（见 [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]）"},{"id":"4e2f094f20e94aa6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)$ (Boolean algebra, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"c16f62394146a157","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"b317b32e88081cdf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ (see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md|58-df-bool